{
  "text": "N\n/\n01\nCreate an editable, reviewable presentation from this idea\nOPENING / 01\nNODESLIDE  ·  SOURCE-AWARE  ·  EDITABLE\n01\n02\nCONTEXT / 02\nThe cost of waiting is usually hidden in repeated work.\nFriction\nConsequence\nDecision window\nFrame the current reality for Decision-makers described in the brief: what is fragmented today, why it matters now, and where momentum is being lost.\nNODESLIDE  ·  SOURCE-AWARE  ·  EDITABLE\n02\n03\nINSIGHT / 03\nA better outcome starts with a sharper point of view.\nCreate a six-slide decision review for a fictional sourcing pilot. All data are illustrative test inputs: pilot volume 100, 120, and 140 units over three months; budget 2000 dollars. Include an editable chart, clearly label assumptions, and end with the decis…\nHonor explicit slide-count and presentation constraints in the brief\nNODESLIDE  ·  SOURCE-AWARE  ·  EDITABLE\n03\n04\nAPPROACH / 04\nTurn the idea into a sequence people can understand and own.\nConnect intent, action, and feedback in one visible operating path so the audience can see both the destination and the mechanics.\nAlign on intent\nNODESLIDE  ·  SOURCE-AWARE  ·  EDITABLE\n04\n05\nEVIDENCE / 05\nDefine proof before asking for commitment.\nUse the brief’s success criteria as qualitative review questions until measured evidence is supplied.\nHonor explicit slide-count and presentation constraints in the brief\nNODESLIDE  ·  SOURCE-AWARE  ·  EDITABLE\n05\n06\nCLOSE / 07\nCreate an editable, reviewable presentation from this idea\n01  Agree the outcome\n02  Name the owner\n03  Set the next checkpoint\nNODESLIDE  ·  SOURCE-AWARE  ·  EDITABLE\n06\nAdd slide\nEdit\nOverview\nCompare\nverified\nSLIDE JOB\nIllustrative pilot only. Review 100 → 120 → 140 units; reference 00123 remains text. Decision: prototype after checking the budget. 中文交接 — no external claims.\nCreate an editable, reviewable presentation from this idea\nOPENING / 01\nNODESLIDE  ·  SOURCE-AWARE  ·  EDITABLE\n01\n1 / 6\nPresenter notes\n25 words\n40%\nFit",
